  m_text: "<size=17>\n-  After any spin which does not trigger the Bingo Feature,
    \             may randomly add a Special prize to 1 unfilled position on the Bingo
    Card.\n-  This Special prize stays for 3 spins.\n-  When a Bingo symbol lands
    on the Special prize, Super Bingo Feature is triggered. \n-  This feature cannot
    be triggered with Magic Hands Feature 1 during the same spin."
