      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=17>\n-  Super Bingo Feature is triggered when a              lands
    on                that is added by the Magic Hands Feature 2.\n-  When Super Bingo
    Feature is triggered, one spin of Wheel Bonus is awarded.\n     -  During Wheel
    Bonus, the Wheel Bonus prize can be Credit, Mini \n        Jackpot, Minor Jackpot,
    Major Jackpot, Mega Jackpot, or Grand Jackpot.\n     -  Range of Credit Prizes
    can be from at least 8x Total Bet up to \n        110x Total Bet during Wheel
    Bonus.\n     -  The Wheel Bonus prize will replace the Wheel symbol and will \n
    \       be used to calculate Super Bingo prizes.\n-  At the end of the Super Bingo
    Feature, all prizes are added and awarded regardless of Bingo Lines.\n-  Bingo
    Card resets after the completion of Super Bingo Feature.\n-  When Bingo Card is
    reset, 2 to 3 random positions on the Bingo Card are filled with Mini Jackpots,
    Minor Jackpots, or Major Jackpots."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5316d286fa94a894888ee12767189de0, type: 2}
